Tzipi Livni

Tziporah Malkah "Tzipi" Livni (basa &lt;a href="Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;: ציפורה מלכה "ציפי " לבני, lair ana &lt;a href="Tel%20Aviv"&gt;Tel Aviv&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;, 8 Juli 1958; umur 56 taun) ya iku &lt;a href="Mantri%20Urusan%20Luar%20Negeri%20Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Mantri Urusan Luar Negeri Israèl&lt;/a&gt; uga &lt;a href="Wakil%20Mahamantri"&gt;Wakil Mahamantri&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;.
Livni uga dadi ketua anggota parté &lt;a href="Kadima"&gt;Kadima&lt;/a&gt;.
Livni ya iku putri saka &lt;a href="Eitan%20Livni"&gt;Eitan Livni&lt;/a&gt;, mantan anggota sayap militér &lt;a href="Irgun%20Tzwai%20Le%27umi"&gt;Irgun Tzwai Le'umi&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèkké ya iku anggota saka parté &lt;a href="Likud"&gt;Likud&lt;/a&gt;.
Livni namataké pasinaoné ana jurusan &lt;a href="hukum"&gt;hukum&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Universitas%20Bar-Ilan"&gt;Universitas Bar-Ilan&lt;/a&gt;.
Livni naté ngabdi ing nagarané dadi &lt;a href="Letnan"&gt;Letnan&lt;/a&gt; ana &lt;a href="Pasukan%20Pertahanan%20Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Pasukan Pertahanan Israèl&lt;/a&gt; (utawa kerep mau Israèl Defence Force IDF).
