Mapai (basa &lt;a href="Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;: מפא" י, akronim kanggo Mifleget Poalei Eretz Yisrael (basa &lt;a href="Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;: מפלגת פועלי ארץ ישראל), lit. Workers' Party of the Land of &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku parté pulitik sayap kiwa ana &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;. Mapai uga parté kang dominan ana pulitik &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;, nganti pungkasé nggabung karo &lt;a href="Alignment"&gt;Alignment&lt;/a&gt; ana partengahan 1960an. Parté iki uga awal saka &lt;a href="Part%C3%A9%20Labor"&gt;Parté Labor&lt;/a&gt;. Kaya parté pulitik &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; liyané, Mapai ya iku singkatan saka Mifleget Poalei Eretz Yisrael (basa &lt;a href="Ibrani"&gt;Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;: מפלגת פועלי ארץ ישראל), kang artiné Parté Lemah Pakarya &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;.
