Kali Bug utawa Kali Buh, utawa kadhang diarani Bug Kulon kanggo mbédaaken karo Kali Bug sing ana ing sisih &lt;a href="kidul"&gt;kidul&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; sing mili saka &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt; tengah nganti &lt;a href="kulon"&gt;kulon&lt;/a&gt;, mbatesi antara &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, ngliwati wates nagara &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;- &lt;a href="Belarusia"&gt;Belarusia&lt;/a&gt; nganti tekan &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi sungapan kali ing &lt;a href="Kali%20Narew"&gt;Kali Narew&lt;/a&gt; ing cedhak &lt;a href="Serock"&gt;Serock&lt;/a&gt; (sing asliné tlaga gawéan &lt;a href="Tlaga%20Zegrze"&gt;Tlaga Zegrze&lt;/a&gt;). Pérangan antara &lt;a href="tlaga"&gt;tlaga&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Kali%20Vistula"&gt;Kali Vistula&lt;/a&gt; kadhang diarani &lt;a href="Bugo-Narew"&gt;Bugo-Narew&lt;/a&gt;. Kali Bug mili dawané 772&amp;nbsp;km (587&amp;nbsp;km dumunung ing tlatah &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;), ndadèkaké kali iki paling dawa angka 4 ing &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;. Kali iki kahubung karo &lt;a href="Kali%20Dnieper"&gt;Kali Dnieper&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Terusan%20Dnieper-Bug"&gt;Terusan Dnieper-Bug&lt;/a&gt;. Miturut tradhisi, Kali Bug kala-kala dianggep dadi wates etnografis antara &lt;a href="Ortodoks"&gt;Ortodoks&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Katulik"&gt;Katulik&lt;/a&gt;. Kali Bug jaman mbiyèn iku antara kakuwatan &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; sasuwéné invasi Polen ing &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%20II"&gt;Perang Donya II&lt;/a&gt;

